---
import data from '../data/wordpress.json';
---
<section id="avaliacoes" class="bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-20"><div class="container-site"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/60">Confiança que se constrói todos os dias</p><h2 class="type-section">O que dizem nossos clientes</h2><div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">{data.reviews.items.map(r => <figure class="rounded-[20px] border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-7"><blockquote class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90" set:html={r.html} /><figcaption class="mt-6"><strong class="block text-sm">{r.name}</strong><span class="mt-1 block text-xs text-white/60">{r.job}</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div></div></section>
